From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DeepSeek Harness <noreply@deepseek.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:12:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Silence the deprecated icon and date-property warnings

The Android compile warned about four APIs the queue still used:
Icons.Rounded.ReceiptLong and Icons.Rounded.Subject move to their
Icons.AutoMirrored.Rounded variants, LocalDate.dayOfMonth/monthNumber move to
day/month.number, and the second price!! in the tags mapper is redundant
because the first one already smart-casts the property.
---
 .../expensetracker/shared/data/ExpenseService.kt  |  4 ++--
 .../database/RecurringExpenseWithTagsMapper.kt    |  2 +-
 .../expensetracker/shared/ui/TillaExpenseCard.kt  | 15 ++++++++-------
 .../ui/settings/SettingsCardLayoutScreen.kt       |  4 ++--
 4 files changed, 13 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

diff --git a/shared/src/commonMain/kotlin/de/dbauer/expensetracker/shared/data/ExpenseService.kt b/shared/src/commonMain/kotlin/de/dbauer/expensetracker/shared/data/ExpenseService.kt
